cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  Multiple linear regression outperforms machine learning for monthly
  temperature forecasting across the Peruvian Altiplano
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a verification study of one-month-ahead monthly
  mean temperature forecasts at the Puno Principal Climatological Station,
  replicated across eleven independent Altiplano series. Multiple linear
  regression, random forest and a multilayer perceptron are compared against
  monthly climatology and persistence under a strictly chronological split,
  with Diebold-Mariano tests and bootstrap confidence intervals.
